Package: datakit
Title: Grouped Assignment, Stata Data, and Portable Parquet
Version: 3.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Bearak", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jbearak@guttmacher.org")
Description: Data preparation in R. d[i, name, by = g] := value makes or
    changes a column of a data frame or tibble for the rows i, within
    groups g: one line in Python, Julia, or Stata, with no ergonomic
    counterpart for data frames in R otherwise. read_dta() and
    save_dta(), from dtaparser, read and write Stata .dta files. Columns
    keep value labels and the extended missing
    values .a to .z, read and set with
    var_label(), val_labels(), with_labels(), and tagged_na(), without
    haven or labelled. read_parquet() and save_parquet() read and write
    Parquet files that keep them too: an interchange format with readers
    and writers in R and TypeScript, so data moves
    between the two with its labels.
License: GPL-3
